 75RB    40CA(40CA,APG):XUNDL-2        2010Da19                           201012
 75RB c  Compiled (unevaluated) dataset from 2010Da19:                          
 75RB2c  Phys Rev C 82, 061303(R) (2010)                                        
 75RB c  Compiled by B. Singh (McMaster) Dec 21, 2010                           
 75RB c  The lifetimes were obtained from the same data as reported in          
 75RB2c  2007Wy01: Phys Rev C 76, 011301(R) (2007). Transition quadrupole       
 75RB3c  moments were deduced from these data. Residual Doppler-shift           
 75RB4c  attenuation method (RDSAM) was used to measure the lifetimes.          
 75RB c  For |g-ray data, see details in a separate dataset in XUNDL database   
 75RB2c  compiled from 2007Wy01                                                 
 75RB c  E=165 MeV. Measured E|g, I|g, |g|g using GAMMASPHERE and               
 75RB2c  Microball arrays. Target=350 |mg/cm{+2} enriched {+40}Ca flashed       
 75RB3c  with 150 |mg/cm{+2} layers of Au on both sides.                        
 75RB c  The level scheme is from 2007Wy01: Phys Rev C 76, 011301(R) (2007)     
 75RB c  Configurations and band terminations are discussed in 2010Da19         
 75RB2c  and comparisons with cranked Nilsson-Strutinsky calculations           
 75RB CL BAND(A)$ Band 1: |p=-,|a=-1/2                                          
 75RB CL BAND(B)$ Band 2: |p=-,|a=+1/2.                                         
 75RB2cL Lifetimes measured for levels of J|p=9/2- to 65/2- (see figure 3       
 75RB3cL of F(|t) plot in 2010Da19). Variation in transition quadrupole         
 75RB4cL moment over the whole range=0.37 eb. Band remains collective at        
 75RB5cL maximum spin                                                           
 75RB CL BAND(C)$ Band 3: |p=+,|a=+1/2.                                         
 75RB2cL Lifetimes measured for levels of J|p=13/2+ to 61/2+ (see figure 3      
 75RB3cL of F(|t) plot in 2010Da19). Variation in transition quadrupole         
 75RB4cL moment over the whole range=0.33 eb. Band remains collective at        
 75RB5cL maximum spin                                                           
